    <script type="application/json" data-bvp-reviews>[{"n": "Miriam Morris", "d": "Dec 23, 2025", "t": "Felt a huge difference after very first shower. Our water sucks though.. Still recommend🙂", "img": []}, {"n": "Rachel Donovan", "d": "Mar 18, 2026", "t": "I used it today. Easy to install, you need to use a decent telfon tape. Mine drips a little, but I am ok with that. I have to say my skin does not itch after taking a shower. My hair feels softer and not like a brillo pad. I'm in the Midwest where the heaviest toxin is Lead. The town I'm in sends out notices about twice a yr about running your cold water for 15-30 seconds before using...and hot water don't think about using it for baby formula.... Where is Erin Brockovich when you need her...lol fast delivery. Thank you", "img": []}, {"n": "Sharon Veihl", "d": "Apr 11, 2026", "t": "I can't wait to get it installed. We have hard water in my apartment complex and my doctor recommended this to reduce eczema on my scalp. It's a good quality filter I would recommend.", "img": []}, {"n": "Aiperi Azamatova", "d": "Jan 22, 2026", "t": "I recommend this to everyone. After moving, I had severe dandruff, and no shampoos helped at all. So I ordered this product, and it saved my hair! Thank you for the fast delivery. It was the first item to arrive out of everything I ordered", "img": []}, {"n": "Elena Kolesnyk", "d": "Dec 25, 2025", "t": "Great, my skin is not as red and itchy anymore", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Nov 19, 2025", "t": "Since I bought this, my skin is not itchy scratchy. It looks healthier buy it. It’s worth it. I love it. Thank you you", "img": []}, {"n": "Yuliani Añanguren", "d": "Dec 1, 2024", "t": "After I put this filter on, I saw quick results in my hair and less dry skin. Highly recommended and easy to install.", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Feb 27, 2026", "t": "The positive reviews had me curious and this was an impulse buy. I never knew why people call it hard water versus soft water before this but after installation it actually felt like the water feels softer. Unsure if it is placebo effect, but I swear the water feels cleaner and less harsh. It was very easy to install. I noticed another reviewer mentioned dirty water during flushing but I didn't notice any while flushing this in the sink. On the other hand I noticed a lot of buildup and black water needed to be flushed from the shower pipe first", "img": ["https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/212a0cb8ac/2557e383-3bbf-43bb-b448-6cba301277c1_4032x3024.jpeg.compressed.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif", "https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/212a0cb8ac/49aeda75-fb0b-4009-8fd6-ed539987e4d2_4032x3024.jpeg.compressed.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif"]}, {"n": "Danielle Brooks", "d": "Jun 2, 2025", "t": "seems to be working well. quality is better than expected. easy install. now I need to order extra filters.", "img": []}, {"n": "Melissa Osborne", "d": "Apr 20, 2025", "t": "I love it. it really does help. I measured the ph and it's really so much of a difference. I've been using it for 2 weeks now. I'd buy one just to put it in storage", "img": []}, {"n": "Marcela Nomelin", "d": "Jan 2, 2025", "t": "Here I show you how the order arrives and everything it includes. I can't comment further because I haven't tried it yet, but I imagine it should be very effective at filtering water. My rating of the product is based on the packaging and material.", "img": ["https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/20a3d41b4e/cbd4bd9c-8203-46f8-91e5-08615d8bf49f_675x1200.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif"]}, {"n": "K. Olivarez", "d": "Oct 26, 2024", "t": "Been using for 3 days now & noticeable difference in skin being softer, skin feels cleaner, nails are glossy, hair is less frizzy. It is pretty effective considering how much I have spent on products to deliver the same results that this shower filter provides. Impressive.", "img": []}, {"n": "Chris Moore", "d": "Jan 16, 2026", "t": "works well does what it says it filters out the water. my water fills 10 times softer and I feel like I'm getting cleaner. five star review", "img": ["https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/21a488dd34/848c41da-6f62-44c0-82f0-fda28e47efd6.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif"]}, {"n": "Vanessa Ruiz", "d": "Jun 5, 2025", "t": "my old filter gave out , water quality out here is badddd. dandruff dry skin, acne. hair loss. this has made my hair and skin soft and stop peeling off. acne is drastically reduced. I literally don't want to know what is in my frickin water but if you're somewhere w chlorine and bacteria ick in your water. 10/10 recommend just for the filter. my whole family is enjoying our shower including our cats. mkay. good water filtration.", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Feb 15, 2025", "t": "Oh yeahhhh!! I'm looking forward to nicer hair and skin!! thank you!! Mr. Seller for your items", "img": ["https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/2029de0000/720f4c41-fcd2-4cbc-8c7c-2d5d1fa3c816.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif", "https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/2029de0000/e19170b8-bae9-47f4-9510-80f69ee96310.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif", "https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/2029de0000/3e96cb77-12c2-4f26-a5c2-5271b6e620b3.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif"]}, {"n": "", "d": "Apr 21, 2025", "t": "Just received this filter, so far the item is as-described and the construction of it is solid. I flushed the filter beforehand and followed the installation instructions (which are fairly simple). Will potentially update my review if anything changes!", "img": ["https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/2013f774c3c/a094cdd6-9013-4cc0-b316-d5ddf5aafcc7_675x1200.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif"]}, {"n": "", "d": "Sep 3, 2025", "t": "For me, it's an extremely necessary product for both skin and hair care. I give it a 10 out of 10; the change is noticeable after using it. I change it about every 6 months, and I highly recommend it to everyone.", "img": ["https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/20150c205be/cdcb4296-c4a9-4829-be9c-9f096f56e3d5_675x1200.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif"]}, {"n": "", "d": "Dec 2, 2025", "t": "I live in Southeast Arkansas where our tap water smells like straight-up pool water. The smell of chlorine is so pungent, I refused to wash my hair in the shower and would only use the faucet water in the kitchen that is filtered. Then I purchased this. Off the bat, it's A LOT larger than I expected, but again, I have no idea about plumbing so what the heck do I know?! But you know what? Size must matter because this thing WORKS! The water from the shower we installed it on no longer smells like chlorine and I'm excited to see how our skin and hair respond.", "img": []}, {"n": "Jessica & John Hartman", "d": "Feb 2, 2025", "t": "Nice shower filter. works well, and is an amazing product. Highly recommend.", "img": []}, {"n": "Amanda Ragusa", "d": "Jan 7, 2026", "t": "Really amazing noticed a difference 1st time I used it", "img": ["https://rewimg.us.kwcdn.com/review-image/21a4882922/3f64429c-d054-4cd1-89b2-52e81e7383e8_675x1200.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient%7CimageView2/2/w/236/q/70/format/avif"]}, {"n": "", "d": "Sep 30, 2024", "t": "great for the price..I haven't used it yet..but all the other filters are great! This particular one is larger so it will last longer. It's really good for your whole body.", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Mar 9, 2025", "t": "Better than getting the same thing for twice or even 3x the price on Amazon. Works the exact same water feels nice and soft like a new filter should make it feel.", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Mar 26, 2025", "t": "great for the price, satisfied.thanks. I appreciate this thing. In an apartment and cannot change all 