 easy to install 🙏 Thank you!", "img": []}, {"n": "Bobby Stephens", "d": "Mar 1, 2026", "t": "works great just don't put it under pressure", "img": []}, {"n": "Elena Soto", "d": "Nov 19, 2024", "t": "easy set up and has all the required pieces. even has the tape.", "img": []}, {"n": "Gale Micheaux", "d": "Mar 11, 2025", "t": "great for the price, satisfied.thanks, nice:), awesome, love it, excellent bargain, perfect, this works very good, great for the price, satisfied.thanks", "img": []}, {"n": "Ebonii Lott", "d": "Jan 1, 2026", "t": "Just got it a couple of days ago but I think I can definitely tell a difference", "img": []}, {"n": "Diego Garcia Restrepo", "d": "Jun 28, 2025", "t": "As always, an excellent product. I've bought it several times to replace the others that need to be changed due to wear and tear.", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Jul 22, 2026", "t": "My crazy daughter threw out my other new ones in a box. So glad I finally recd this one. We have hard water here in Utah so I need this filter for my severly itchy skin. Thanks Temu.", "img": []}, {"n": "Alex Medina", "d": "Aug 7, 2025", "t": "The product arrived in great condition, thank you very much. It's perfect.", "img": []}, {"n": "Marquies Adams", "d": "Jul 27, 2026", "t": "Work absolutely amazing. The water even fell chase major different. ￼", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Mar 12, 2026", "t": "I just installed this filter and it was pretty simple and it seems to be working well.", "img": []}, {"n": "Unai Mendoza", "d": "May 4, 2025", "t": "Even the smallest details are taken care of 👍👌... It comes with its own Teflon and rubber to ensure a good seal and prevent leaks", "img": []}, {"n": "", "d": "Aug 4, 2026", "t": "It does a good job. It’s made of plastic, but it’s sturdy. When you install it, make sure to use the washers that come included. I didn’t, and I ended up having to redo the installation.", "img": []}]</script>
