  <div class="bvp-review-modal" data-bvp-review-modal hidden>
    <div class="bvp-review-modal-scrim" data-bvp-review-close></div>
    <div class="bvp-review-modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="bvp-review-form-title">
      <button type="button" class="bvp-review-modal-x" data-bvp-review-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <h3 id="bvp-review-form-title" class="bvp-serif">Share your shower.</h3>
      {% form 'contact', class: 'bvp-review-form' %}
        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
          <p class="bvp-review-thanks" data-bvp-review-posted>Thank you. Your review is in our inbox. We read and post every real one, usually within a day.</p>
        {% else %}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[product]" value="{{ product.title | escape }}">
          <label>Your name
            <input type="text" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" required>
          </label>
          <label>Email <span class="bvp-review-quiet">(never shown)</span>
            <input type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required>
          </label>
          <label>Your rating
            <select name="contact[rating]">
              <option value="5" selected>5 stars</option>
              <option value="4">4 stars</option>
              <option value="3">3 stars</option>
              <option value="2">2 stars</option>
              <option value="1">1 star</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>Your review
            <textarea name="contact[body]" rows="5" required placeholder="What changed for your skin or hair?"></textarea>
          </label>
          <p class="bvp-review-quiet">Photos help other buyers. After you submit, reply to our confirmation email with your before and after shots and we will attach them.</p>
          <button type="submit" class="bvp-atc bvp-atc--inline">Submit review</button>
        {% endif %}
      {% endform %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% # ================= FAQ ================= %}
  <section class="bvp-faq" id="bvp-faq" aria-labelledby="bvp-faq-title">
    <h2 id="bvp-faq-title" class="bvp-serif bvp-center">Fair questions.</h2>
    <div class="bvp-faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>Will it help my itchy, sensitive skin?</summary>
        <p>That&rsquo;s who it&rsquo;s built for. Chlorine and sediment are the usual triggers behind post-shower itch, and this strips them out. Most people feel it in the first few showers.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will it fit my shower?</summary>
        <p>It threads onto standard half inch shower arms, the fitting on nearly every US shower. If yours is the exception, send it back within 30 days.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will it change my water pressure?</summary>
        <p>Most people notice no difference. A cartridge at the very end of its life can slow the flow, which is the clearest sign it&rsquo;s time to swap it.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do I need a plumber or tools?</summary>
        <p>No. It installs by hand in about five minutes. Thread tape is included.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How often do I replace the cartridge?</summary>
        <p>About every three months. Replacements are always in stock here.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>When will I notice anything?</summary>
        <p>The feel of the water changes from the first shower. Everything else depends on your water and your skin, which is exactly why the 30 day window exists.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if I want to return it?</summary>
        <p>You have 30 days from delivery. Details in our <a href="/policies/refund-policy">return policy</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% # ================= CLOSE ================= %}
  <section class="bvp-close" aria-labelledby="bvp-close-title" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.55), rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.82)), url({{ 'bluvana-ritual-texture.webp' | asset_url }});">
    <div class="bvp-close-inner">
      <p class="bvp-close-eyebrow">The 30-day shower test</p>
      <h2 id="bvp-close-title" class="bvp-serif">Calmer skin.<br>Or your money back.</h2>
      <p class="bvp-close-sub">Shower with it for a month. If your skin and hair don&rsquo;t feel the difference, send it back and we refund every cent.</p>
      <a class="bvp-atc bvp-atc--inline bvp-close-cta" href="#bv-buy">Choose your filter<span class="bvp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <ul class="bvp-close-proof" role="list">
        <li>30-day money-back guarantee</li>
        <li>Installs by hand in 5 minutes</li>
        <li>Cartridge lasts about 3 months</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="bvp-stickybar" data-bvp-sticky hidden>
